n, where he had the various interviews with Moses and Aaron recorded in the book of Exodus.","verses":138,"father":"","mother":"","v":[10,11]}],"places":[{"id":"horeb_576","name":"Horeb","kind":"Church","lat":28.58771,"lon":33.92168,"summary":"Desert or mountain of the dried-up ground, a general name for the whole mountain range of which Sinai was one of the summits (Ex. 3:1; 17:6; 33:6; Ps. 106:19, etc.).","verses":16,"v":[1]},{"id":"midian_796","name":"Midian","kind":"Region","lat":28.75,"lon":34.75,"summary":"An Arabian tribe descended from Midian. They inhabited principally the desert north of the peninsula of Arabia. The peninsula of Sinai was the pasture-ground for their flocks.","verses":44,"v":[1]},{"id":"egypt_362","name":"Egypt","kind":"Region (Country)","lat":26.4902,"lon":29.8808,"summary":"The land of the Nile and the pyramids, the oldest kingdom of which we have any record, holds a place of great significance in Scripture.","verses":564,"v":[7,10,11,12,16,17,18,19,20,21,22]}],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[4872,4872,1961,7462,6629,6629,2859,2859,2859,3503,3548,3548,4080,4080,5090,5090,6629,6629,310,310,310,310,4057,4057,4057,935,935,413,2722,2022,2022,430,430],[4397,4397,4397,3068,3068,3068,7200,413,413,3827,3827,3827,784,8432,8432,5572,5572,7200,7200,5572,5572,1197,784,784,369,369,369,369,398],[4872,4872,559,5493,5493,5493,5493,7200,7200,2088,1419,4758,4069,4069,5572,5572,3808,1197,1197],[3068,3068,3068,7200,3588,5493,5493,5493,5493,7200,7200,430,7121,7121,413,413,8432,8432,5572,5572,4872,4872,2009,559,559,559,559],[408,408,7126,1988,1988,559,559,5394,5394,5275,5275,3588,4725,4725,834,859,5975,5975,6944,6944,127],[559,559,559,595,430,430,430,1,1,1,430,430,85,85,430,430,3327,3327,430,430,430,3290,3290,4872,4872,4872,5641,6440,6440,3588,3372,3372,3372,5027,5027,413,430],[3068,3068,559,7200,7200,7200,7200,6040,6040,5971,5971,5971,4714,4714,8085,8085,8085,8085,6818,6818,6440,6440,5065,5065,3588,3045,3045,3045